==By-election results==

A [[by-election]] occurs when seats become vacant between council elections. Below is a summary of by-elections from 1983 onwards.<ref name=byelections>{{Cite web|url=https://www.electionscentre.co.uk/?page_id=3933 |title=By-elections |access-date=18 January 2026 |work=[[Colin Rallings]] & [[Michael Thrasher]] |publisher=The Elections Centre, [[Plymouth University]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260118204355/https://www.electionscentre.co.uk/?page_id=3933 |archive-date=18 January 2026}}</ref> Full by-election results are listed under the last regular election preceeding the by-election and can be found by clicking on the ward name.

